issue-board/6-private-notes/*
!issue-board/6-private-notes/.gitkeep

# BOARD.md is a derived artifact, regenerated by `lyt board` from the issue
# frontmatter (the source of truth). Tracking it causes recurring merge
# conflicts on multi-change PRs. See issue-board/README.md.
issue-board/BOARD.md

# Local, transient AI-wrapper session journal — absorbed into issue frontmatter
# via `lyt absorb`, never committed.
.runtime/

# Cross-model audit prompts, regenerated by `lyt review --export`. They embed a
# snapshot of the board and weigh hundreds of KB each — derived artefacts, like
# BOARD.md (ADR-0002). Never committed. See ISS-0133.
review/

# JOURNAL.md is derived too, regenerated by `lyt journal --write` from the
# closed issues. Same contract as BOARD.md (ADR-0002): read it, never edit it,
# never commit it.
JOURNAL.md
